{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been recruited for a space exploration mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your orders are simple: <strong>walk to the bridge at the end of the corridor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something isn\u2019t right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no bridge, only another corridor. And each time you walk through, things begin to <strong>change</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it a glitch in the system? A test? A trap? Or something more sinister?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you see something different, turn back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If everything is normal, carry on.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do this correctly and eventually you'll make it 'To The Bridge'.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Our Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/extras/18219f184489d6505e7b8a0601648a48.avif?t=1752770200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/extras_big/18219f184489d6505e7b8a0601648a48.avif?t=1752770200 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u201360 minutes depending on observation and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you <strong>make the right choices</strong> to finally reach the bridge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short atmospheric walking simulator</strong> with a sci-fi theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping corridor gameplay</strong>: each loop might appear normal... or subtly (or overtly) different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation-based puzzle mechanics</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>everything is normal</strong>, carry on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>something is different</strong>, go back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wrong and the loop resets.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist controls</strong> focused entirely on walking and watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a small rolling droid</strong> companion that appears in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle horror and psychological tension</strong> as you question reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> to enhance the feeling of isolation and unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set aboard a dark, looping spaceship corridor</strong> with dynamic lighting and sci-fi visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Speedrun Mode</strong>: Successfully make it to the bridge to unlock a speedrun mode with a built in timing system.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pattern Recognition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691270/9e5e76298a7d146b96c64783fbfc9a555e5244e4.jpg"},{"name":"Corrective Action","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691270/2e4e6919004e759bac799e2b81d8a3f2fa12a5f0.jpg"},{"name":"To The Bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691270/bb218c07987f011156848d33a8f2f960f7ab4519.jpg"},{"name":"Simulation Breach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691270/d10f3c91e01d0fbb7a90a06bb18856b25aff20c7.jpg"},{"name":"Warp Speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691270/743b01cc2227d115d234ce73116de5cff29af149.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691270?t=1752770200","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/cc114688adead482eb7532c0a4b07ca555e03c0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752770200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/115973d2b3ed3caf87bc7e4a3b7ce4da7d5601ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752770200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/115973d2b3ed3caf87bc7e4a3b7ce4da7d5601ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752770200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been recruited for a space exploration mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your orders are simple: <strong>walk to the bridge at the end of the corridor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something isn\u2019t right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no bridge, only another corridor. And each time you walk through, things begin to <strong>change</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it a glitch in the system? A test? A trap? Or something more sinister?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you see something different, turn back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If everything is normal, carry on.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do this correctly and eventually you'll make it 'To The Bridge'.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Our Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/extras/18219f184489d6505e7b8a0601648a48.avif?t=1752770200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/extras_big/18219f184489d6505e7b8a0601648a48.avif?t=1752770200 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u201360 minutes depending on observation and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you <strong>make the right choices</strong> to finally reach the bridge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short atmospheric walking simulator</strong> with a sci-fi theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping corridor gameplay</strong>: each loop might appear normal... or subtly (or overtly) different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation-based puzzle mechanics</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>everything is normal</strong>, carry on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>something is different</strong>, go back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wrong and the loop resets.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist controls</strong> focused entirely on walking and watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a small rolling droid</strong> companion that appears in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle horror and psychological tension</strong> as you question reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> to enhance the feeling of isolation and unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set aboard a dark, looping spaceship corridor</strong> with dynamic lighting and sci-fi visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Speedrun Mode</strong>: Successfully make it to the bridge to unlock a speedrun mode with a built in timing system.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Blott Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":